      "name": "reflex-dev/xy",
      "type": "repo",
      "brief": "Fourth day on the list and the only entry today confirmed by three unrelated collectors \u2014 npm downloads, GitHub stars and HackerNews. Downloads are up 41% week over week against 4.4% star growth, and 65 open issues on 1,296 stars is a high ratio: people are running it in anger rather than admiring it. The watcher count sits at 3, which is the one discordant note \u2014 almost nobody has committed to following the project despite using it.",
