      "type": "repo",
      "brief": "207 HackerNews points and 75 comments against 287 stars and 4 forks. Attention running well ahead of adoption: a lot of people read about it, very few took it home. Stars grew 7.4% and forks 9.1% overnight, so the gap is closing slowly rather than not at all. It has already left the front page, which makes the next two days the test.",
